1
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:36,000
Her web connects them all.

2
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:06,000
Madame Web is a action, fantasy film directed by S.J. Clarkson.

3
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Forced to confront revelations about her past, paramedic Cassandra Webb forges a relationship with three
young women destined for powerful futures...if they can all survive a deadly present.

4
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Cassandra Webb, played by Dakota Johnson.

5
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
Julia Cornwall, played by Sydney Sweeney.

6
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Anya Corazón, played by Isabela Merced.

7
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Mattie Franklin, played by Celeste O'Connor.

8
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Ezekiel Sims, played by Tahar Rahim.

9
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:36,000
O'Neil, played by Mike Epps.

10
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Madame Web is a 2024 American superhero film
featuring the character from Marvel Comics.

11
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
It is the fourth film in Sony's Spider-Man Universe (SSU).

12
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Dakota Johnson stars as the titular character, alongside Sydney Sweeney, Isabela Merced,
Celeste O'Connor, Tahar Rahim, Mike Epps, Emma Roberts, and Adam Scott.

13
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
The film was directed by S.

14
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Clarkson from a screenplay she wrote with Claire Parker alongside
the writing team of Matt Sazama and Burk Sharpless.

15
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
The film depicts the origin story of Cassie Webb (Johnson), who confronts her past while trying to save three young women (Sweeney,
Merced, O'Connor) from Ezekiel Sims (Rahim), who wants to kill them before they become Spider-Women in the future and kill him.

16
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Sony Pictures began developing a Madame Web film for its shared universe by
September 2019, with Sazama and Sharpless writing the script.

17
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
Clarkson joined as the director in May 2020, in her feature film
directorial debut, and Johnson was cast in early 2022.

18
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
Further castings occurred in the following months,
particularly for the Spider-Women characters.

19
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:36,000
Filming began in mid-July 2022 and wrapped before the end of the year,
occurring throughout Massachusetts, New York City, and Mexico.

20
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
Clarkson and Parker's involvement as writers was revealed in November 2023.

21
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:36,000
Johan Söderqvist, a frequent collaborator of
Clarkson, composed the film's score.

22
01:39:00,000 --> 01:39:06,000
Madame Web premiered at the Regency Village Theatre in Westwood, Los Angeles, on February 12, 2024, and was
released in the United States two days later by Columbia Pictures via Sony Pictures Releasing.

23
01:43:30,000 --> 01:43:36,000
The film was panned by critics and was a box-office bomb, grossing $100.5
million worldwide against a net production budget of $80 million.

24
01:48:00,000 --> 01:48:06,000
It received three Golden Raspberry Awards: Worst Picture, Worst
Actress (for Johnson), and Worst Screenplay.

25
01:52:30,000 --> 01:52:36,000
The film explores themes of new york city, spider,
based on comic, teenage girl, super power.
